<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Sept 27, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Sept 27  WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 6,362    6,564 12,120</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     308	219    554</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    863	863  1,306</p>
<p>Total					 7,533    7,646 13,980</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 4,948    5,244   unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     139	144   unq</p>
<p>CCC stocks				  1,887    1,887   unq</p>
<p>Total					 6,974    7,275   unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
